{"id":8956057,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/merge_requests/9329","number":9329,"state":"merged","title":"stem_indexer增补 [UT/STC/非法拦截] 用例，修复alpha=0.01精度问题","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/9329","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/9329/issues","body":"## 描述\n\n此 PR 主要聚焦于 `stem_indexer` 算子的精度修复与测试体系重构。核心修复：`CalcDynamicTopkCount` 函数在 `alpha=0.01` 等小值时因早期 `int32` 截断导致插值精度丢失，改为全程 `float32` 计算后 `floor` 取整；同时修复了双核分工中 `int64_t` 加法潜在的溢出问题。测试方面，将 UT 从硬编码用例重构为 CSV 驱动的参数化测试框架，新增 `InferShape/InferDType/Tiling` 三类参数化 UT，相应调整 `batch` 测试中 `metadata` 的构建流程以支持非法拦截场景。\n\n主要改动：\n\n- `CalcDynamicTopkCount` 精度修复: 在 `stem_indexer_service_vector.h` 中，将 `kEnd` 和插值计算改为全程 `float32`，最终通过 `static_cast<int32_t>`（正数等价 `floor`）取整，并增加 `<1.0f` 钳制保护，避免早期 `int32` 截断导致的 `alpha` 小值精度问题\n- 双核分工溢出修复: `InitSparseIndicesToNegOne`、`ProcessTopK`、`ProcessDirectOutput` 三处计算 `curAivGS1Idx` 和 `curAivGS1ProcNum` 时，将 `curGS1ProcNum` 先转为 `uint64_t` 再加 `1`，防止大值 `int64_t` 加法溢出\n- `Golden` 参考对齐: `stem_indexer_golden.py` 中新增 `fma_float32` 模拟 `Ascend` 核的 `float32` 乘加语义，`calc_topk_budget` 改用 `math.floor` 替代 `int()` 转换，并修正 `decay_len <= 1` 的边界判断\n- UT 参数化重构: 删除旧硬编码的 `test_stem_indexer_infershape.cpp`，新增 `stem_indexer_param.h` 定义 `StemIndexerTilingUtParam/StemIndexerInferShapeUtParam/StemIndexerInferDTypeUtParam` 三类参数结构体，并在对应测试文件中通过 CSV 驱动实例化，补全 UT/STC/非法拦截用例覆盖\n- Batch 测试 `metadata` 流程调整: 将 `build_metadata` 从 `stem_indexer_pt_save.py` 移至 `stem_indexer_pt_loadprocess.py`，在加载阶段动态构造 `metadata` 并传入算子调用，移除预置 `metadata` 的保存逻辑\n\n## 关联的Issue\n<!-- 如果这个PR是为了解决特定的Issue，请在这里提供Issue链接。例如：关联Issue #000-->\n<!-- 如果这个PR是为了解决特定的问题单，请在这里描述问题单单号。-->\n\n## 测试\n<!--描述进行了哪些测试来验证你的改动。包括但不限于二级冒烟、算子泛化等。-->\n\n## 文档更新\n<!--如果这个PR包含文档的更新，请在这里指出。例如：更新了README.md文件。-->\n\n## 类型标签\n<!--  [x] 表示选中 -->\n- [x] \uD83D\uDC1B Bug修复\n- [ ] ✨ 新特性\n- [ ] ⚡ 性能优化\n- [ ] ♻️ 重构\n- [x] \uD83E\uDDEA 测试\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDCE6 构建/CI\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDD27 配置变更\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDCDD 文档更新\n- [ ] ⬆️ 依赖升级\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDD12 安全修复\n- [ ] \uD83E\uDDF9 代码清理\n- [ ] ❓ 其他，请描述：\n","assignees_number":25,"assignees":[{"id":"6822c87d24adff5452d7ba18","login":"Allan_Yu","name":"YuZhengzhong","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Allan_Yu","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68c115ac4dcd85262391d21a","login":"wenxin_fight","name":"wenxin_fight","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wenxin_fight","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822b81724adff5452d7afc2","login":"monologue815","name":"monologue815","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/monologue815","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68c2315759d71b2d89a80e41","login":"tang-hao-hw-gitcode","name":"tang-hao-hw-gitcode","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/tang-hao-hw-gitcode","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6877715d70f8532fca319fe9","login":"liudan12","name":"liudan12","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/liudan12","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822c79924adff5452d7b9b8","login":"yang-binrong","name":"yang-binrong","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/yang-binrong","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822c187053cff786c91063e","login":"xuanyuandy","name":"xuanyuandy","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/xuanyuandy","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"676e56c602d89015b9f1eb74","login":"hz36amy_00","name":"yf_zhou","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fc/fe/f7239cf91485e812c31979edd3584327eaab4edbd7f232c495d1e234e28e9df3.png?time=1757139706596","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/hz36amy_00","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68c130b72c2c2604ed91d3d4","login":"miaofangzheng","name":"miaofangzheng","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/miaofangzheng","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68cb6b98bf2bee2835bde0ff","login":"zzy__","name":"赵志勇","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zzy__","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"681c6dec4